<view class="page">
  <view class="mine-head">
    <text class="t-mono">LOCAL FIRST · 可选云端同步</text>
    <text class="t-lg" style="display:block;margin-top:12rpx">人生时限</text>
    <text class="t-small" style="display:block;margin-top:10rpx">不用登录、不看通讯录。默认只存在这台手机；开了云同步才会上云，随时可关、可导出、可删。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="stat-grid">
    <view class="stat-cell" wx:for="{{stats}}" wx:key="key"
          data-type="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onStatTap" hover-class="stat-cell-hover">
      <text class="stat-num">{{item.value}}</text>
      <text class="t-mute">{{item.label}}</text>
      <text class="stat-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="stat-tip"><text class="t-mute">点任一数字，查看它背后的明细 ›</text></view>

  <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">内容版本</text><text class="section-label">DATA</text></view>
  <view class="card" bindtap="copyVersion">
    <view class="row-between"><text class="t-title">{{meta.commit}}</text><text class="section-more">点此复制 ›</text></view>
    <text class="t-small" style="display:block;margin-top:10rpx">{{meta.sections}} 节 · {{meta.items}} 条 · {{meta.aidCards}} 张急救卡</text>
    <text class="t-small">生成于 {{meta.builtAt}}</text>
    <text class="t-mute" style="display:block;margin-top:8rpx">{{meta.source}} · 点击复制完整版本信息</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">数据与隐私</text><text class="section-label">{{syncLabel}}</text></view>
  <view class="card" bindtap="goPrivacy">
    <view class="row-between">
      <view>
        <text class="t-title">{{syncTitle}}</text>
        <text class="t-small" style="display:block;margin-top:8rpx">{{syncDetail}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="chev">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="sync-bar">
      <view class="sync-dot sync-{{syncTone}}"></view>
      <text class="t-mute">{{syncHint}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">功能入口</text></view>
  <view class="card" style="padding:0 28rpx">
    <view class="list-item row-between" bindtap="goCalc"><text class="t-body">算账器（{{calcCount}} 个）</text><text class="chev">›</text></view>
    <view class="list-item row-between" bindtap="goElder"><text class="t-body">长辈端大字模式</text><text class="chev">›</text></view>
    <view class="list-item row-between" bindtap="goAid"><text class="t-body">处境急救卡</text><text class="chev">›</text></view>
    <view class="list-item row-between" bindtap="copyFeedback"><text class="t-body">反馈时限错误</text><text class="chev">›</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">已知边界</text><text class="section-label">HONEST LIMITS</text></view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="limit-row" wx:for="{{limits}}" wx:key="*this">
      <text class="limit-dot">·</text><text class="t-small">{{item}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">本地埋点</text><text class="section-label">仅本机可见</text></view>
  <view class="card">
    <view wx:if="{{trackRows.length === 0}}" class="t-mute">还没有记录</view>
    <view class="row-between track-row" wx:for="{{trackRows}}" wx:key="key">
      <text class="t-small">{{item.label}}</text><text class="t-mono">{{item.count}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top:24rpx;color:#C0392B" bindtap="clearAll">清空全部数据（本机 + 云端）</button>

  <view class="disclaimer">
    内容改编自开源作品《高性价比人生指南》（作者 eternity4719，CC BY-NC-SA 4.0）与《人情世故指南》（作者 changxueyi，CC BY 4.0），本小程序免费提供、不用于商业目的，并以相同许可共享。
    时限规则仅供提示，涉及法条与地方规定请以官方发布为准；本工具不替代专业医疗、法律与急救建议。
  </view>
</view>
